---
// Section 9 — surface-3 (warm break: verde-musgo-deep).
// Cosmology section: shows the etymology of "Iarandu" as the fusion of IA + arandu.
// "Iarandu" is dominant; "Ia" + "arandu" are subordinate factors below.
// The shared "a" bridges the two source words and carries the section's urucum.
---

<section class="surface-3 section-pad-loose has-ambient" aria-labelledby="arandu-title">
  <svg
    class="ambient-curve"
    viewBox="0 0 1600 900"
    preserveAspectRatio="xMaxYMid slice"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <path
      data-curve
      d="M 1240 420
         C 1240 380, 1220 340, 1180 340
         C 1110 340, 1050 410, 1080 500
         C 1110 600, 1240 640, 1340 580
         C 1480 500, 1500 320, 1340 200
         C 1140 60, 820 100, 700 320
         C 580 540, 760 820, 1080 880
         C 1480 940, 1900 700, 2000 320"
    />
    <path
      data-curve
      style="transition-delay: 600ms;"
      d="M 900 460
         C 900 430, 880 400, 850 400
         C 800 400, 770 450, 800 510
         C 830 570, 920 580, 970 530"
    />
  </svg>

  <div class="container-narrow">
    <h2 id="arandu-title" class="display-xl reveal" style="line-height: 1.0; letter-spacing: -0.025em;">
      <span class="accent-azul">I</span><span class="accent-urucum">a</span><span class="accent-verde">randu</span><span style="color: var(--ink-soft);">.</span>
    </h2>

    <div
      class="reveal mt-[56px] md:mt-[80px] grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr] gap-[16px] md:gap-[40px] items-start"
      style="transition-delay: 600ms;"
    >
      <div>
        <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--linha-papel); margin-bottom: 20px;" />
        <p class="font-display" style="font-style: italic; font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 48px); color: var(--azul-ceu); line-height: 1;">
          Ia
        </p>
        <p class="mt-[14px] body-sm" style="letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-soft);">
          inteligência artificial
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="font-display"
        aria-hidden="true"
        style="font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 36px); font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink-muted); line-height: 1; padding-top: 28px;"
      >
        +
      </div>

      <div>
        <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--linha-papel); margin-bottom: 20px;" />
        <p class="font-display" style="font-style: italic; font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 48px); color: var(--verde-folha); line-height: 1;">
          arandu
        </p>
        <p class="mt-[14px] body-sm" style="letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-soft);">
          sabedoria, em tupi-guarani
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mt-[88px] md:mt-[120px] body-lg measure-tight" style="transition-delay: 800ms;">
      <p>
        A Iarandu é a fusão dessas duas palavras: a tecnologia que vem dos centros de pesquisa, e a sabedoria que vem da terra. Compartilham a mesma vogal por uma razão.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-[24px]">
        Tecnologia, para nós, tem origem na natureza, não na geometria fria do Vale do Silício. Referências: floresta, rio, nuvem. Formas: proporção áurea, curva logarítmica.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
